## 9. Alur Kerja (Flow)

### 9.1 Detection Pipeline

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    E[Event / Telemetri] --> N[Normalisasi OCSF]
    N --> EN[Enrichment Role & Identitas]
    EN --> RE{Rule Engine}
    EN --> ML{ML / UEBA Engine}

    RE -->|rule match| S1[Sinyal 1: Deterministik]
    ML -->|deviasi baseline| S2[Sinyal 2: Anomali]

    S1 --> RS[Risk Scoring Engine]
    S2 --> RS

    RS -->|skor >= threshold| AL[Generate Alert]
    RS -->|skor < threshold| NC[Update Entity Risk - no alert]

    AL --> CM[Case Management / Triage]
    CM --> ES[Eskalasi ke Pusat / SOAR]
    CM --> FB[Feedback Analis]
    FB --> ML
```

**Penjelasan:**
1. Event/Telemetri masuk dari endpoint dan sumber log.
2. Normalisasi ke OCSF.
3. Enrichment menambah konteks role.
4. Dua mesin deteksi paralel: **Rule Engine** (deterministik) + **ML/UEBA** (deviasi baseline).
5. Risk Scoring menggabungkan sinyal menjadi skor 0–100.
6. Skor ≥ threshold → Alert; jika tidak → hanya update skor (tanpa mengganggu).
7. Case Management untuk triage dan eskalasi.
8. Feedback analis dipakai untuk tuning ML → mengurangi false positive.

### 9.2 Alur Data End-to-End (Sequence)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant E as Endpoint Agent
    participant N as Node Kodam (Ingestion)
    participant D as Detection (Rule+ML)
    participant R as Risk Scoring
    participant C as Pusat (Orchestrator)
    participant A as Analis CSIRT

    E->>N: telemetri (proses, file, network, logon, USB)
    N->>N: normalisasi OCSF + enrich role
    N->>D: event ter-enrich
    D->>D: rule check + baseline deviasi
    D->>R: sinyal anomali
    R->>R: hitung skor risiko entity
    alt skor >= threshold
        R->>C: eskalasi alert + skor
        C->>C: korelasi lintas node
        C->>A: alert + timeline investigasi
        A->>C: verdict (true/false)
        C->>N: feedback tuning baseline
    else skor < threshold
        R->>R: update skor tanpa alert
    end
```

### 9.3 Orkestrasi Berjenjang

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    PUSAT[Satsiber TNI AD / Pussiberad<br/>Kartika CSIRT — Tier 0] --> K1[CSIRT Kodam A — Tier 1]
    PUSAT --> K2[CSIRT Kodam B — Tier 1]
    PUSAT --> K3[CSIRT Kodam C — Tier 1]

    K1 --> S1[Satuan A1 — Tier 2]
    K1 --> S2[Satuan A2 — Tier 2]
    K2 --> S3[Satuan B1 — Tier 2]
    K3 --> S4[Satuan C1 — Tier 2]
    K3 --> S5[Satuan C2 — Tier 2]

    PUSAT -.->|policy & baseline turun| K1
    PUSAT -.->|policy & baseline turun| K2
    PUSAT -.->|policy & baseline turun| K3
    K1 -.->|policy turun| S1
    K1 -.->|policy turun| S2
    S1 -->|telemetri naik| K1
    S2 -->|telemetri naik| K1
    K1 -->|alert & risiko naik| PUSAT
    K2 -->|alert & risiko naik| PUSAT
    K3 -->|alert & risiko naik| PUSAT
```

- **Downstream (turun):** policy (baseline role, rule, playbook) dari pusat ke Kodam → satuan.
- **Upstream (naik):** telemetri satuan ke Kodam; Kodam deteksi lokal & eskalasi alert + risiko ke pusat.
- **Korelasi pusat:** anomali dari beberapa Kodam digabung untuk deteksi insider terdistribusi.

### 9.4 Alur Eskalasi & Respons (Incident Workflow)

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Anomali Terdeteksi] --> B{Skor Risiko}
    B -->|Rendah < 30| C[Log & Pantau]
    B -->|Sedang 30-69| D[Alert ke Analis Kodam]
    B -->|Tinggi >= 70| E[Alert Kritis ke Pusat]

    D --> F[Investigasi Timeline]
    E --> F
    F --> G{Konfirmasi Insider Threat?}
    G -->|Tidak / False Positive| H[Feedback → Tuning Baseline]
    G -->|Ya| I[Eskalasi Komando + Response]
    I --> J[Playbook Respons:<br/>quarantine / blokir egress / snapshot bukti]
    J --> K[Laporan & Audit Trail]
```

### 9.5 Deployment Topologi (Satu Node Kodam)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph Kodam["Kodam X (Tier 1)"]
        subgraph K8s["Platform Node"]
            ING[Ingestion Kafka]
            NORM[Normalisasi OCSF]
            ENR[Enrichment]
            RULE[Rule Engine]
            ML[ML/UEBA]
            RISK[Risk Scoring]
            API[API Gateway]
        end
        DB[(Time-series DB<br/>ClickHouse/Timescale)]
        DASH[Dashboard Lokal]
    end

    ENDP[Endpoints] --> ING
    ING --> NORM --> ENR --> RULE --> RISK
    ENR --> ML --> RISK
    RISK --> DB
    DASH --> API --> DB
    RISK -->|eskalasi| PUSAT[Pusat Tier 0]
    PUSAT -.->|policy| RULE
    PUSAT -.->|policy| ML
```

