## 10. Functional Requirements (FR)

### 10.1 Koleksi Telemetri (Mata 2 — Data & Endpoint)
- **FR-01:** Agent ringan di endpoint (Windows/Linux): proses, file access, network, USB, logon, volume transfer, command.
- **FR-02:** Koleksi log sistem (Windows Event Log, Syslog, auditd) + integrasi sumber (AD/LDAP, proxy, email, cloud).
- **FR-03:** Normalisasi ke skema OCSF.

### 10.2 Behavioral Baselining (Mata 1 — Identitas & Perilaku)
- **FR-04:** Baseline per-entity (user), per-role (peer group), per-endpoint.
- **FR-05:** Baseline berbasis waktu (jam, hari, pola mingguan) & statistik (mean, std, moving average).
- **FR-06:** Warm-up period otomatis (7–14 hari) sebelum baseline valid.

### 10.3 Role-Based Anomaly Detection
- **FR-07:** Setiap role punya parameter baseline & threshold anomali (lihat §11).
- **FR-08:** Rule engine deterministik (Sigma).
- **FR-09:** ML/statistik: Isolation Forest (outlier), Autoencoder (reconstruction error), peer group analysis; **LSTM = roadmap**.
- **FR-10:** Deteksi 8 kategori: eksfiltrasi data, privilege abuse, lateral movement, anomali logon, proses mencurigakan, mass file access, USB, config tampering. *(akun terkompromi = outcome lintas-kategori)*

### 10.4 Risk Scoring
- **FR-11:** Skor 0–100 dengan kontributor tertimbang (severity, deviasi, frekuensi, durasi).
- **FR-12:** Decay skor seiring waktu.
- **FR-13:** Korelasi multi-sinyal untuk kurangi false positive.

### 10.5 Orkestrasi (Mata 3 — Jaringan & Komando)
- **FR-14:** Arsitektur 3 tier dengan federasi.
- **FR-15:** Propagasi policy dari pusat ke node.
- **FR-16:** Eskalasi alert & agregasi risiko dari node ke pusat.
- **FR-17:** Korelasi lintas node.

### 10.6 Response & Workflow
- **FR-18:** Alert triage & case management.
- **FR-19:** Automated response playbook (quarantine, blokir egress, snapshot bukti) — opsional dengan konfirmasi.
- **FR-20:** Investigasi timeline per entity.

### 10.7 Presentation
- **FR-21:** Dashboard command center: risk heatmap, daftar entity berisiko, tren.
- **FR-22:** Detail entity: baseline vs aktual, kontributor, timeline.
- **FR-23:** Laporan kepatuhan & audit trail.

### 10.8 Integrasi
- **FR-24:** Integrasi SIEM (kirim alert) & SOAR (trigger playbook).
- **FR-25:** Integrasi identity source (AD/LDAP).
- **FR-26:** API & webhook.

---

## 11. Role-Based Baseline Parameters

Ini inti TRINETRA. Setiap role didefinisikan dengan parameter yang diawasi; ketika nilai aktual **melewati threshold** (statis/relatif), sistem membangkitkan anomali.

### 11.1 Parameter Umum per Role

| Parameter | Deskripsi | Unit |
|---|---|---|
| **Data Egress Volume** | Total data keluar (upload/transfer) | MB/hari |
| **Egress Destination** | Tujuan transfer (internal/cloud pribadi/asing) | kategori |
| **Login Time Window** | Jam dan hari login normal | jam |
| **Login Location** | Lokasi/sumber IP normal | lokasi |
| **Files Accessed** | Jumlah file diakses | file/hari |
| **Endpoints Accessed** | Jumlah sistem diakses | endpoint/hari |
| **Command Types** | Jenis command dijalankan | whitelist/blacklist |
| **Process Execution** | Proses dijalankan | daftar |
| **USB Usage** | Penggunaan media eksternal | event |
| **Privilege Changes** | Perubahan/escalation privilege | event |
| **Email Attachments** | Lampiran email keluar | ukuran/jumlah |
| **Config Changes** | Perubahan konfigurasi sistem | event |

### 11.2 Contoh Baseline & Threshold per Role

| Role | Parameter | Baseline Normal | Threshold Anomali | Contoh Insiden |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| **Admin Satsiber** | Data egress | < 100 MB/hari | > 500 MB/hari **atau** > 5× baseline | Eksfiltrasi data besar |
| **Admin Satsiber** | Command types | admin standar | `rm -rf`, `dd`, `mimikatz`, `nc` | Penghancuran/eksfiltrasi |
| **CSIRT Analyst** | Endpoints accessed | 10–20/hari | > 100/hari (mass access) | Akses massal |
| **CSIRT Analyst** | Command types | tool analisis standar | destructive/offensive di luar SOP | Penyalahgunaan tool |
| **Operator** | Login time | 06:00–18:00 | login 02:00 | Akses di luar jam kerja |
| **Personel Satuan** | Files accessed | < 50/hari | > 500/hari (mass copy) | Pencurian data massal |
| **Personel Satuan** | USB usage | 0 (dilarang) | terdeteksi USB | Eksfiltrasi offline |
| **Data Custodian** | Config changes | sesuai jadwal maint | di luar jendela maint | Backdoor / tampering |
| **Semua role** | Login location | kantor/barak | impossible travel | Akun terkompromi |

### 11.3 Mekanisme Threshold (Hybrid)

1. **Threshold Statis** — nilai absolut kebijakan (mis. egress > 1 GB = kritis).
2. **Threshold Relatif (Baseline)** — deviasi historis (mis. 5× rata-rata 30 hari).
3. **Threshold Peer-Group** — deviasi dari rekan se-role.
4. **Threshold ML** — skor anomali model di atas ambang.

---

## 12. Non-Functional Requirements (NFR)

| Kategori | Requirement |
|---|---|
| **Kinerja** | Deteksi near-real-time (< 60 detik); dashboard responsif. |
| **Skalabilitas** | Ribuan endpoint, ratusan ribu event/hari per node; federasi multi-node. |
| **Ketersediaan** | HA di tier pusat (99.9%); node lokal tetap berfungsi saat terputus (offline-first). |
| **Keamanan** | Enkripsi in-transit & at-rest; RBAC ketat; audit trail; least privilege; data minimisasi. |
| **Reliabilitas** | Minim false positive (tuning, peer-group, multi-sinyal); retry & buffering. |
| **Interoperabilitas** | OCSF, STIX/TAXII, REST API, integrasi SIEM/SOAR. |
| **Compliance** | RFC 2350 (CSIRT), MITRE ATT&CK/Insider Threat, privasi personel. |
| **Usability** | Dashboard intuitif; investigasi satu klik. |

---

## 13. Success Metrics / KPI

| KPI | Target |
|---|---|
| **Detection Coverage** | ≥ 8 kategori anomali insider |
| **Time-to-Detect (TTD)** | < 60 detik event → alert |
| **False Positive Rate** | < 10% (tuning + multi-sinyal) |
| **Baseline Akurasi** | Stabil setelah warm-up 7–14 hari |
| **Orkestrasi** | 3 tier end-to-end dalam demo |
| **Investigasi** | Timeline entity < 2 detik |

---

## 14. Scope, Realistis vs Visi

### 14.1 In Scope (MVP Hackathon)
- Agent telemetri (Windows/Linux): proses, file, network, logon, USB, egress.
- Pipeline normalisasi OCSF + enrichment role.
- Baseline per role + rule engine + ML (Isolation Forest/Autoencoder).
- Risk scoring 0–100.
- Deteksi 8 kategori anomali.
- Dashboard command center + detail entity + timeline.
- Orkestrasi 3 tier (simulasi pusat → Kodam → satuan).
- Integrasi contoh SIEM.

### 14.2 Out of Scope (Roadmap)
- Psycho-social indicators (MITRE) penuh — butuh data HR.
- Full SOAR automation tanpa konfirmasi.
- Hardware sensor fisik khusus.
- Skala produksi jutaan endpoint.

### 14.3 Realistis vs Visi (Kredibilitas Teknis)

| Kategori | Status |
|---|---|
| Role-based baseline (statistik), rule engine (Sigma), telemetri endpoint, Isolation Forest, risk scoring, dashboard, alert/case, timeline, korelasi dasar, Zero Trust risk context | **Realistis (MVP)** |
| IAM/MFA, EDR, SIEM, DLP, network monitoring | **Perlu integrasi** |
| UEBA penuh (peer-group + LSTM), entity relationship analysis, AI-assisted investigation (LLM), psycho-social indicators, SOAR otomatis, federasi STIX/TAXII | **Visi jangka panjang (roadmap)** |

---

## 15. Roadmap

| Fase | Fokus |
|---|---|
| **Fase 1 — Prototype & PoC** | Telemetri endpoint, baseline per role, deteksi anomali, dashboard |
| **Fase 2 — Pilot** | Uji terbatas, tuning false positive |
| **Fase 3 — Regional Integration** | Penyebaran node regional, korelasi regional |
| **Fase 4 — Central Orchestration** | Korelasi lintas regional, federasi, threat-intel sharing |
| **Fase 5 — Advanced AI** | UEBA penuh (LSTM/peer-group), AI-assisted investigation |

*(selaras dengan roadmap PRD: MVP → V1.1 peer-group/SOAR → V1.2 psycho-social → V2.0 federasi penuh)*

---

## 16. Risiko & Mitigasi

| Risiko | Mitigasi |
|---|---|
| **False positive tinggi** | Multi-sinyal, peer-group, decay, threshold adaptif, feedback loop analis |
| **Privasi personel** | Data minimisasi, pseudonimisasi, least privilege, kebijakan akses ketat |
| **Insider menyerang TRINETRA** | RBAC, audit trail, deteksi anomali pada pengelola platform |
| **Keterbatasan data warm-up** | Baseline cepat + threshold statis sementara + peer-group global |
| **Node terputus dari pusat** | Offline-first, buffering, sinkronisasi saat tersambung |
| **Adversarial evasion** | Deteksi berlapis (rule + ML + peer group) |

---

## 17. Tech Stack

| Lapisan | Teknologi |
|---|---|
| Agent endpoint | eBPF (Linux), ETW (Windows), Osquery |
| Ingestion | Kafka / Redpanda |
| Normalisasi | OCSF schema, Logstash/Vector |
| Storage | ClickHouse / TimescaleDB, PostgreSQL |
| ML | Python (scikit-learn: Isolation Forest, PyOD autoencoder), MLflow |
| Rule engine | YARA-like / Sigma (detection-as-code) |
| API/Orkestrasi | FastAPI, gRPC, Kafka Streams |
| Dashboard | React + D3/Recharts, Grafana (opsional) |
| Integrasi | REST, STIX/TAXII, Webhook, Sigma → SIEM |

