|---|---|
| Relevansi & Manfaat (25%) | Menjawab kebutuhan pengamanan IT/OT TNI AD: insider threat di ekosistem CSIRT |
| Inovasi Teknis (25%) | Role-based behavioral baseline + orkestrasi 3 tier |
| Fungsionalitas Purwarupa (25%) | MVP end-to-end: telemetri → deteksi → skor → dashboard → orkestrasi |
